{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792809788.1659179, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :What's new:"}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792809788.4712179, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :Clover C1.5.9 (v1.5.9):"}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792809788.773348, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2022 Helpers now start when your chat is not inside a code project, instead of being refused after a restart."}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792809789.07901, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2022 Helpers working in a real code project still get their own safe copy, and still stop if that copy cannot be m\u2026"}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792809789.379366, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2022 When a helper is refused, the message now names the exact setting to change."}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792809789.6820412, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2022 The two helper isolation settings are now known, so changing them no longer shows a warning."}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792809789.98432, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2022 Identified 1.5.6 gateways no longer stop an update just because their reply-delivery code is older."}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792809790.286649, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2022 Updates keep restart work pending if ownership or a quiet restart cannot be verified; one reply may repeat."}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792809790.588912, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2026and 10 more"}
